{"id":"0631285f0a620556","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-binary-sequence-programs.md","title":"有限二进制串的长度、位与前缀程序","display":"df-binary-sequence-programs — 有限二进制串的长度、位与前缀程序","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-binary-sequence-programs","aliases":["72-df-binary-sequence-programs"],"display":"df-binary-sequence-programs — 有限二进制串的长度、位与前缀程序","depends_on":["[[72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library]]"],"chapter":"IV","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV WKL/subsystems discussion and §2.1.1; local realization of the existing binary-string code","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-binary-sequence-programs"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-binary-sequence-programs</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-binary-sequence-programs — 有限二进制串的长度、位与前缀程序"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b2a9860b6b90f561\" href=\"?note=b2a9860b6b90f561\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library\">72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IV"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV WKL/subsystems discussion and §2.1.1; local realization of the existing binary-string code"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用前一原子的编译与确定程序；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,i,k\\in\\omega\">\\(x,i,k\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(s\\in\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，首位按下标0存为最低有效位；空串允许。下式 c 是外部编码函数；其余粗体字是 PR 程序。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c_2(s):=2^{|s|}-1+\\sum_{i&lt;|s|}s_i2^i.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c_2(s):=2^{|s|}-1+\\sum_{i&lt;|s|}s_i2^i.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{blen}&amp;:=[\\Sigma_b([\\mathsf{ble}(\\mathsf{bpow}(2,S(i)),S(x))]_{x,i})(x,S(x))]_x,\\\\\n\\mathsf{bdata}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{bsub}(S(x),\\mathsf{bpow}(2,\\mathsf{blen}(x)))]_x,\\\\\n\\mathsf{bbit}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{bif}(\\mathsf{blt}(i,\\mathsf{blen}(x)),\\mathsf{brem}(\\mathsf{bquot}(\\mathsf{bdata}(x),\\mathsf{bpow}(2,i)),2),0)]_{x,i},\\\\\n\\mathsf{bpref}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{bif}(\\mathsf{ble}(k,\\mathsf{blen}(x)),\\mathsf{badd}(\\mathsf{bsub}(\\mathsf{bpow}(2,k),1),\\mathsf{brem}(\\mathsf{bdata}(x),\\mathsf{bpow}(2,k))),0)]_{x,k}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{blen}&amp;:=[\\Sigma_b([\\mathsf{ble}(\\mathsf{bpow}(2,S(i)),S(x))]_{x,i})(x,S(x))]_x,\\\\\n\\mathsf{bdata}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{bsub}(S(x),\\mathsf{bpow}(2,\\mathsf{blen}(x)))]_x,\\\\\n\\mathsf{bbit}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{bif}(\\mathsf{blt}(i,\\mathsf{blen}(x)),\\mathsf{brem}(\\mathsf{bquot}(\\mathsf{bdata}(x),\\mathsf{bpow}(2,i)),2),0)]_{x,i},\\\\\n\\mathsf{bpref}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{bif}(\\mathsf{ble}(k,\\mathsf{blen}(x)),\\mathsf{badd}(\\mathsf{bsub}(\\mathsf{bpow}(2,k),1),\\mathsf{brem}(\\mathsf{bdata}(x),\\mathsf{bpow}(2,k))),0)]_{x,k}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>长度用有界和计算 floor(log₂(x+1))，避开一个未指定的最小化程序。代码区间 [2ⁿ−1,2ⁿ⁺¹−2] 恰表示长度 n。bbit 越界返回0，bpref 越界也返回0；合法前缀保留低 k 位并加回长度偏移。这里明确构造原稿 WKL 已经调用却未给出程序身份的三个 PR 符号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library","status":"resolved","id":"b2a9860b6b90f561","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"x,i,k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"c_2(s):=2^{|s|}-1+\\sum_{i<|s|}s_i2^i.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{blen}&:=[\\Sigma_b([\\mathsf{ble}(\\mathsf{bpow}(2,S(i)),S(x))]_{x,i})(x,S(x))]_x,\\\\\n\\mathsf{bdata}&:=[\\mathsf{bsub}(S(x),\\mathsf{bpow}(2,\\mathsf{blen}(x)))]_x,\\\\\n\\mathsf{bbit}&:=[\\mathsf{bif}(\\mathsf{blt}(i,\\mathsf{blen}(x)),\\mathsf{brem}(\\mathsf{bquot}(\\mathsf{bdata}(x),\\mathsf{bpow}(2,i)),2),0)]_{x,i},\\\\\n\\mathsf{bpref}&:=[\\mathsf{bif}(\\mathsf{ble}(k,\\mathsf{blen}(x)),\\mathsf{badd}(\\mathsf{bsub}(\\mathsf{bpow}(2,k),1),\\mathsf{brem}(\\mathsf{bdata}(x),\\mathsf{bpow}(2,k))),0)]_{x,k}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1992,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增5项：[[72-df-binary-sequence-programs]] · [[72-df-full-omega-model]] · [[72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library]] · [[72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness]] · [[72-thm-full-omega-model-subsystems]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增5项：[[72-df-binary-sequence-programs]] · [[72-df-full-omega-model]] · [[72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library]] · [[72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness]] · [[72-thm-full-omega-model-subsystems]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增5项：[[72-df-binary-sequence-programs]] · [[72-df-full-omega-model]] · [[72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library]] · [[72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness]] · [[72-thm-full-omega-model-subsystems]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增5项：[[72-df-binary-sequence-programs]] · [[72-df-full-omega-model]] · [[72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library]] · [[72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness]] · [[72-thm-full-omega-model-subsystems]]"},{"id":"109b0b8d7ee4cec9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$c_2,\\mathsf{blen},\\mathsf{bbit},\\mathsf{bpref}$ 采用 [[72-df-binary-sequence-programs]]，程序解释对应由 [[72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness]] 给出。$E_{\\rm PR},\\operatorname{Def}_{\\rm PR},f_c$ 取 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]；对象语法固定为 $\\mathcal L_2(E_{\\rm PR})$。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增5项：[[72-df-binary-sequence-programs]] · [[72-df-full-omega-model]] · [[72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library]] · [[72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness]] · [[72-thm-full-omega-model-subsystems]]"},{"id":"5d6d95eb13748e1d","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增5项：[[72-df-binary-sequence-programs]] · [[72-df-full-omega-model]] · [[72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library]] · [[72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness]] · [[72-thm-full-omega-model-subsystems]]"},{"id":"c5706cc0c55f220a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-binary-sequence-programs]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-38","locations":[